	     LAN) is kept only in the dev flavor: the build phase «Strip dev-only
	     ATS (prod)» removes it unless the configuration's xcconfig sets
	     LAWBID_ALLOWS_LOCAL_NET = YES (Flutter/*-dev.xcconfig only).
	     S12 #25 (25.11, MASVS-NETWORK-2): NSPinnedDomains → NSPinnedCAIdentities,
	     Apple's built-in pinning («Identity Pinning: How to configure server
	     certificates for your app», developer.apple.com). Same SPKI SHA-256
	     list and hosts as android/app/src/main/res/xml/network_security_config.xml
	     (the order there names each CA); scripts/ci/cert-pins-check.mjs keeps
	     both equal and checks them against the live chains every day.
	     Covers NSURLSession, so the API client (cupertino_http) and the native
	     players. -->
